Quality-ratchet

This project extracts generic code-quality tooling from Chronote and Perkcord.
Chronote source: https://github.com/Chronote-gg/Chronote/tree/53d5593904c0d220989506ae23e7fe39f21a0b37
Perkcord source: https://github.com/Perkcord/perkcord/tree/6f4e39fa1204c434ed52746e4975e3b439f2bb3b

Chronote's package.json declares AGPL-3.0-or-later and author BASIC-BIT.
The accompanying LICENSE is copied verbatim from that source snapshot.
The project retains those terms; the stock license text alone is not the basis
for the or-later declaration.

Perkcord is private and has no root LICENSE at the inspected snapshot.
The owner explicitly authorized public extraction of generic checker code and
tests on 2026-10-17. That authorization does not license unrelated product code
or remove third-party notices. Resolve each extracted file's notices and terms
before publication. No Perkcord checker source is included in the initial setup.

Installed dependencies retain their own licenses and notices. See
package-lock.json and docs/provenance.md for exact versions and source inventory.
